WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.133
Mamo!

2
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.266
- Wow, we can rent Mamoswine?
- Pika, pika.

3
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.733
We have to get over a snowy mountain to get to Anistar City.

4
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.266
Right! That's why we need Mamoswine,

5
00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.266
who aren't bothered by snow in the least.

6
00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.366
- Wow.
- Mamo.

7
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.433
Pika.

8
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.866
Mamoswine. The Twin Tusk Pokémon.

9
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.333
As the temperature got hotter after the Ice Age,

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.966
it's said many Mamoswine disappeared.

11
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.200
I'm Bonnie! Nice to meet you!

12
00:00:37.266 --> 00:00:38.800
Mamo! Mmmph! Mamo!

13
00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:40.933
- That tickles!
- That's really sweet.

14
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.166
And observing those gigantic tusks up close is so impressive!

15
00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:47.433
- Sure is. Wow!
- OK, time to make your choice.

16
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.100
Then please return them to one of our staff members

17
00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:51.666
on the other side of the mountain.

18
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.233
- Right! We understand.
- Pikachu.

19
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.466
- How many can ride on one?
- Two, maximum.

20
00:00:57.533 --> 00:00:59.100
Bonnie, how about I ride with you?

21
00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:02.533
- 'Kay, Serena, looks it's you and me.
- Right!

22
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.166
Remember, it's gonna be really cold.

23
00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:08.533
We also have snow gear on hand, in case you wanna rent any.

24
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.766
- That's great. Thanks a lot!
- Pika.

25
00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:14.166
-Pika!

26
00:01:14.233 --> 00:01:17.166
Mam! Mamo!

27
00:01:17.233 --> 00:01:19.666
Mamoswine sure are enormous, aren't they?

28
00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:21.900
Hey, you doing OK back there?

29
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.600
- Pikachu.
- Hang in there, Clemont.

30
00:01:24.666 --> 00:01:26.700
This is by far the quickest way there!

31
00:01:26.766 --> 00:01:30.433
Don't worry! I'll be right here with you the whole time, big brother!

32
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.433
Thanks a lot, little sis!

33
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.533
- All right, let's move on out!
- Mamo.

34
00:01:36.533 --> 00:01:38.733
Go, Mamoswine! Let's win!

35
00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.933
Bonnie! This isn't a race!

36
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

37
00:01:42.866 --> 00:01:44.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

38
00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:48.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

39
00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

40
00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:53.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

41
00:01:53.366 --> 00:01:56.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

42
00:01:56.633 --> 00:02:00.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

43
00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:04.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

44
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:08.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

45
00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

46
00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.000
Over the Mountain of Snow!

47
00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:23.700
As our heroes continue their journey to Anistar City,

48
00:02:23.766 --> 00:02:26.600
where Ash will battle for his seventh Kalos Gym Badge,

49
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:31.466
they're now crossing a snowy mountain by riding Mamoswine.

50
00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:34.500
-Check it out!

51
00:02:34.566 --> 00:02:37.966
- That's steep and snowy!
- Pika, pika.

52
00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:41.433
All right. We'll be the first ones to go up that hill.

53
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.633
- Then you two can come after us.
- Right behind you, Ash.

54
00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.466
The mountain pass could be treacherous.

55
00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:48.700
Nothing wrong with taking it slow and easy.

56
00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:51.400
OK. Make sure you hang on tight!

57
00:02:51.466 --> 00:02:54.233
- Mm-hm.
- Let's go, Mamoswine.

58
00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.633
Mamo.

59
00:02:57.633 --> 00:02:59.400
Mamoooo.

60
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.666
- You're doing just great.
- Ma... mo.

61
00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:07.566
Swine.

62
00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:11.700
-Mamooo.

63
00:03:11.766 --> 00:03:14.866
- Just a little more.
- Pika, pika.

64
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.566
Mamo...

65
00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:19.333
You can do it!

66
00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:25.733
Mamo!

67
00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.133
- Serena, you OK?
- Mm-hm.

68
00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.933
You did an amazing job stopping us, Mamoswine.

69
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.566
All right, Ash! I think we'd better find another way around!

70
00:03:34.633 --> 00:03:37.000
- I don't know.
- Let me take the reins, please?

71
00:03:37.066 --> 00:03:38.066
- Huh?
- Pika?

72
00:03:38.133 --> 00:03:39.433
Come on, Ash!

73
00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.300
Don't forget all the training I got from my mom, the champion Rhyhorn racer.

74
00:03:43.366 --> 00:03:45.800
That's right! I know you'll be great!

75
00:03:45.866 --> 00:03:48.666
Now, Mamoswine. All set?

76
00:03:48.733 --> 00:03:51.100
Just relax and go slowly.

77
00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:54.400
Mamo.

78
00:03:54.466 --> 00:03:57.666
Mo! Mam.

79
00:03:57.733 --> 00:03:59.633
- You're doing really well.
- Mo.

80
00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:04.933
Mamoswine.

81
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.466
- Mamo.
- Slow and easy.

82
00:04:07.533 --> 00:04:12.166
- We'll be up on the top in no time.
- Mamoswine.

83
00:04:12.233 --> 00:04:13.633
Nice and slow.

84
00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:15.866
Mamo.

85
00:04:15.933 --> 00:04:19.000
One step at a time. That's it.

86
00:04:19.066 --> 00:04:21.066
Just a little bit more.

87
00:04:21.133 --> 00:04:23.766
- I know you can do it!
- Mamos!

88
00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:27.866
Mamoswine!

89
00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.900
Wow! You're amazing, Mamoswine!

90
00:04:30.966 --> 00:04:32.000
Yay!

91
00:04:32.066 --> 00:04:35.000
You did it! Thank you so much!

92
00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:36.300
Whew.

93
00:04:36.366 --> 00:04:38.866
- That was great, Serena!
- Pika!

94
00:04:38.933 --> 00:04:41.300
Mamoswine did it, not me!

95
00:04:41.366 --> 00:04:44.166
Just a little bit longer and we'll reach the top.

96
00:04:44.233 --> 00:04:45.733
Mamo.

97
00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.000
This is fun! Yay!

98
00:04:51.066 --> 00:04:54.866
Mamo.

99
00:04:54.933 --> 00:05:00.466
- Mamo.
- Mamo.

100
00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:03.433
- We really made it! Wow!
- All right!

101
00:05:04.366 --> 00:05:07.933
Ah! We're so high up!

102
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.800
- Let's climb down, right away!
- Relax!

103
00:05:10.866 --> 00:05:13.666
- We haven't been climbing that long.
- Bonnie's right.

104
00:05:13.733 --> 00:05:14.933
So let's move on out!

105
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.800
- Clemont, you'll be just fine!

106
00:05:20.933 --> 00:05:23.400
Ah. So cold!

107
00:05:23.466 --> 00:05:26.666
All because the twerps forced us to come to this frosty freeze!

108
00:05:26.733 --> 00:05:29.466
We should have rented a few Mamoswine like they did!

109
00:05:29.533 --> 00:05:34.000
I don't do cold all that well when I know my electric blankie's waitin' for me!

110
00:05:34.066 --> 00:05:37.133
Now that's the way.

111
00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.166
You know exactly the right thing to do!

112
00:05:39.233 --> 00:05:40.800
Gour!

113
00:05:40.866 --> 00:05:43.000
We're not cold at all!

114
00:05:43.066 --> 00:05:46.066
-Gourgeist!

115
00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:50.666
It's freezing! Enough of this. Now. I want a sauna, stat!

116
00:05:56.766 --> 00:05:58.666
- Huh.

117
00:05:58.733 --> 00:06:01.100
Easy... Nice and easy...

118
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:02.866
What an amazing view!

119
00:06:02.933 --> 00:06:04.433
Pika.

120
00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.600
Huh. Ah! Ah! Huh?

121
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:12.166
-Pika, pika!

122
00:06:12.233 --> 00:06:16.300
- Ash. I'm scared. I'm scared.
- Calm down, Serena!

123
00:06:16.366 --> 00:06:18.800
It'll quit swaying when the wind stops!

124
00:06:18.866 --> 00:06:20.500
Yeah...

125
00:06:21.933 --> 00:06:25.500
- Wow. What a relief.
- OK, let's go!

126
00:06:25.566 --> 00:06:27.633
Right.

127
00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.400
- Hey, guys, we're right behind you!
- Yay, that was fun!

128
00:06:31.466 --> 00:06:32.633
Denne-ne!

129
00:06:36.233 --> 00:06:40.066
- Mamoswine.
- Aaah!

130
00:06:40.133 --> 00:06:42.733
- Way to go, Serena!
- Pika.

131
00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.966
Thanks, you two.

132
00:06:44.033 --> 00:06:46.533
- Thank goodness we got through that.
- Ne-ne-ne!

133
00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.433
- Yay! Let's do it again!
- Denne-ne!

134
00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.966
- Not for all the money in the world.
- Huh.

135
00:06:52.033 --> 00:06:53.733
Let's keep going!

136
00:06:56.633 --> 00:07:00.200
- Brr!
- Cold. So cold.

137
00:07:00.266 --> 00:07:03.833
Huh. There's a cave!

138
00:07:08.266 --> 00:07:10.866
- What is that?
- It's an Abomasnow!

139
00:07:11.933 --> 00:07:13.833
Blocking the door, eh?

140
00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.766
Abomasnow!

141
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:20.000
Say, I've been looking around everywhere for an understudy for Gourgeist.

142
00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:21.466
Perfect timing!

143
00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.366
Gourgeist!

144
00:07:24.433 --> 00:07:25.966
Shadow Ball!

145
00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:28.333
Gourgeist!

146
00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.833
Aboma!

147
00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.566
- Oy vey! Not a scratch!
- Use Seed Bomb!

148
00:07:33.633 --> 00:07:35.266
Ga-ga-ga-ga!

149
00:07:36.433 --> 00:07:38.000
Boma!

150
00:07:38.066 --> 00:07:40.566
Gour!

151
00:07:40.633 --> 00:07:44.400
- Come on! It's no walk in the park.
- OK. Inkay!

152
00:07:45.733 --> 00:07:46.966
Inkay!

153
00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.233
Use Psybeam, now!

154
00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.766
Inkay!

155
00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:53.233
Snow!

156
00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:56.866
Aboma!

157
00:07:59.433 --> 00:08:01.666
We call foul!

158
00:08:01.733 --> 00:08:03.233
Wobbuffet!

159
00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.466
Boma.

160
00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.166
Snover.

161
00:08:16.233 --> 00:08:17.666
-Pika.

162
00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:23.033
- There's a boulder blocking the path!
- I don't see any other way around it.

163
00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:27.000
- Yeah. And we don't wanna go back.
- What should we do?

164
00:08:28.566 --> 00:08:32.200
- Hold on. What are you two gonna do?
- Pika, pika?

165
00:08:32.266 --> 00:08:34.000
-Pika!

166
00:08:34.066 --> 00:08:36.566
- Pika!

167
00:08:36.633 --> 00:08:39.000
Everybody! You've gotta hang on tight!

168
00:08:43.166 --> 00:08:45.933
- Uh!
- Pika.

169
00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.666
- Their power's incredible!
- Yay, Mamoswine! You're so strong!

170
00:08:49.733 --> 00:08:50.933
Denne-ne!

171
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.233
- You did it!
- Yeah, Mamoswine.

172
00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.933
- Thanks!
- Pika!

173
00:08:57.633 --> 00:09:00.466
- Pika.
- Hm. Something wrong, buddy?

174
00:09:00.533 --> 00:09:03.066
- Pika.
- Mamo.

175
00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:05.800
- Mamoswine.
- Huh?

176
00:09:05.866 --> 00:09:09.366
Pika. What is it this time?

177
00:09:09.433 --> 00:09:12.400
Hey, Ash, I think we're going the wrong way!

178
00:09:12.466 --> 00:09:15.800
- Mamoswine?
- Please turn around!

179
00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.733
Mamoswine.

180
00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.400
I wonder if something's in there.

181
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:28.133
Aboma!

182
00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.933
Who's that?

183
00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.100
Abomasnow. The Frost Tree Pokémon.

184
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.833
Abomasnow live quietly on mountains where it always snows.

185
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.966
They make blizzards for camouflage.

186
00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:40.766
Abomasnow.

187
00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:42.400
Snow!

188
00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:47.400
What's going on? Mamoswine! Let's move!

189
00:09:47.466 --> 00:09:50.000
- Mamoswine!
- Snow!

190
00:09:50.066 --> 00:09:53.733
-Pika, pika.

191
00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.600
Huh. Is that a Pokémon back there?

192
00:09:58.233 --> 00:10:00.733
Snover. The Frost Tree Pokémon.

193
00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.900
When the weather turns cold, Snover moves to lower elevations.

194
00:10:03.966 --> 00:10:06.600
It returns to the mountain's snow-covered summit in spring.

195
00:10:06.666 --> 00:10:10.100
- Something's not right!
- Maybe that Snover's sick!

196
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:13.333
So that Abomasnow could be protecting Snover.

197
00:10:14.633 --> 00:10:17.433
- Ash?

198
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.933
Abomasnow! We're not trying to hurt anyone!

199
00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.566
So you've gotta stop trying to hurt us, OK?

200
00:10:23.633 --> 00:10:26.366
- Pika, pika!
- Mamoswine.

201
00:10:26.433 --> 00:10:27.833
Mamoswine.

202
00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:30.566
Snow!

203
00:10:30.633 --> 00:10:32.966
Abomasnow! You've gotta believe us!

204
00:10:33.033 --> 00:10:35.066
- That's right!
- Pikachu.

205
00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.100
Snow.

206
00:10:38.166 --> 00:10:40.733
- Let's go!
- Right!

207
00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.633
- Thank you!
- Abomasnow?

208
00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.533
You're really worried about that Snover, right?

209
00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.533
Abomasnow.

210
00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.600
- How is it?
- Oh! Burning up.

211
00:10:50.666 --> 00:10:52.700
You're right. We've gotta do something.

212
00:10:52.766 --> 00:10:54.700
Can you make it better, Clemont?

213
00:10:54.766 --> 00:10:59.833
Now if I recall, there should be spring moss and mountain marigold somewhere.

214
00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.466
Let's go find some and give it to Snover.

215
00:11:02.533 --> 00:11:04.566
- Spring moss?
- Mountain marigold?

216
00:11:04.633 --> 00:11:06.500
- Here they are!
- Right.

217
00:11:06.566 --> 00:11:09.833
Spring moss is a plant that grows in areas around hot springs.

218
00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:12.266
Mountain marigold blooms wherever there's snow.

219
00:11:12.333 --> 00:11:16.266
If I remember, there's a hot spring deep inside Frost Cavern.

220
00:11:16.333 --> 00:11:19.633
OK, Serena, why don't we get busy and look for some spring moss?

221
00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.533
- Right.
- We'll go look for mountain marigold.

222
00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.000
- 'Kay. Let's go!
- Uh?

223
00:11:25.066 --> 00:11:26.866
Chespin!

224
00:11:26.933 --> 00:11:29.733
Chespin, so you'll look after Snover for us?

225
00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:31.866
- Che.
- Pi, pi. Pika, pika!

226
00:11:31.933 --> 00:11:36.533
- Great. You stay here, too, Pikachu.
- And you, too, Braixen!

227
00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.666
Braix.

228
00:11:37.733 --> 00:11:40.733
'Kay, let's get going!

229
00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.666
- Let's get going too!
- Abomasnow!

230
00:11:47.733 --> 00:11:50.833
- We won't let you down, promise!
- Aboma!

231
00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.366
Who's that Pokémon?

232
00:12:01.066 --> 00:12:03.933
It's Abomasnow!

233
00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.866
Abomasnow!

234
00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:20.266
- It's kind of like a maze.
- Let's check out each one.

235
00:12:31.066 --> 00:12:33.566
Huh. A dead end.

236
00:12:37.633 --> 00:12:40.800
- Not this way!

237
00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.633
Ash? We can't search all of them.

238
00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:50.633
I know! All right, Noibat, I choose you!

239
00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:53.533
Noibat, noi!

240
00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:56.366
There's a hot spring somewhere inside this cave.

241
00:12:56.433 --> 00:12:59.166
Do you think you can find it with your echolocation?

242
00:12:59.233 --> 00:13:01.000
Noibat.

243
00:13:01.066 --> 00:13:04.233
Noi...

244
00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:08.533
Noibat. Noi,

245
00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.266
-Wow, you found it? Then lead the way!

246
00:13:14.933 --> 00:13:17.933
We'll never find anything in all this snow.

247
00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.366
Huh?

248
00:13:20.433 --> 00:13:23.100
The future is now, thanks to science!

249
00:13:23.166 --> 00:13:25.566
Clemontic Gear, on!

250
00:13:25.633 --> 00:13:30.133
I thought we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one.

251
00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.800
I call it my Snow-Flower Finder!

252
00:13:33.866 --> 00:13:35.433
So, what does it do?

253
00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.800
It's obviously a machine that can detect a flower's faint scent

254
00:13:38.866 --> 00:13:42.166
while it blooms under the snow, and then shows us its location!

255
00:13:42.233 --> 00:13:45.433
- Hey, maybe this one will work!
- Leave it to me!

256
00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.800
Power, on!

257
00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:57.033
- It's right below us!
- You found it already? Amazing!

258
00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.466
- And that's your cue!
- Bunnelby.

259
00:14:00.533 --> 00:14:04.666
Bunnelby. I need you to dig out the flower that's blooming here under the snow.

260
00:14:04.733 --> 00:14:07.466
- Bunn!
- Hm.

261
00:14:09.733 --> 00:14:14.200
You did it! Wait. That's a Chesto Berry.

262
00:14:14.266 --> 00:14:16.233
So, what does that mean?

263
00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.766
Well... That's so strange.

264
00:14:18.833 --> 00:14:20.866
I'll try again with the power on full!

265
00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:24.933
Huh. It's detecting a lot more!

266
00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.366
We'll just have to search for them one by one!

267
00:14:27.433 --> 00:14:28.433
'Kay!

268
00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.133
- Snover.
- Pika.

269
00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.366
- Sno! Sno!
- Pika!

270
00:14:32.433 --> 00:14:35.166
- Pika!
- Sno. Sno.

271
00:14:35.233 --> 00:14:36.866
Pika, Pikachu!

272
00:14:36.933 --> 00:14:38.900
- Braix.
- Che, che!

273
00:14:40.566 --> 00:14:43.000
- Che, che!
- Brai? Brai!

274
00:14:43.066 --> 00:14:45.000
Chespin, Chespin, che!

275
00:14:45.066 --> 00:14:47.833
- Braix? Brai?
- Chespin! Chespin, pin.

276
00:14:48.966 --> 00:14:50.200
Che...

277
00:14:50.266 --> 00:14:53.033
Che-e-e-e!

278
00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.366
Brai? Braix!

279
00:14:57.433 --> 00:14:58.933
Che.

280
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.333
Braix?

281
00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:05.000
- Chespin!
- Brai. Braixen.

282
00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.233
Sno. Sno.

283
00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:13.233
- Che. Che.
- Pika. Pika.

284
00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.733
Che.

285
00:15:16.266 --> 00:15:18.233
Sno.

286
00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.266
- Braixen, Braixen.
- Che?

287
00:15:20.333 --> 00:15:22.200
- Pika, pika!
- Che!

288
00:15:22.266 --> 00:15:24.466
Abomasnow.

289
00:15:27.533 --> 00:15:29.966
It's a hot spring!

290
00:15:30.033 --> 00:15:32.700
Which means it should be here.

291
00:15:34.133 --> 00:15:37.200
Ash, look way over there!

292
00:15:37.266 --> 00:15:39.833
Spring moss.

293
00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.366
Yeah! Found it!

294
00:15:44.666 --> 00:15:47.433
I'm picking up a strong signal around here.

295
00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.300
-Huh.

296
00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:51.233
Huh?

297
00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.900
Yay! Mountain marigold!

298
00:15:54.966 --> 00:15:57.133
I have nothing that reaches that high.

299
00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:00.300
- I'll go get it!
- Huh. Bonnie?

300
00:16:00.366 --> 00:16:02.600
Hey, don't worry.

301
00:16:02.666 --> 00:16:05.500
- All right, I'll leave this up to you.
- 'Kay.

302
00:16:05.566 --> 00:16:07.233
Go! Ah!

303
00:16:09.033 --> 00:16:11.533
Ah... Uh...

304
00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.700
- I got it!
- Nice job, Bonnie!

305
00:16:14.766 --> 00:16:17.966
- It's the science twerp.
- I'm bringing you down!

306
00:16:18.033 --> 00:16:19.700
-What are they up to?

307
00:16:21.266 --> 00:16:23.933
- Will this help Snover feel better?
- Yeah.

308
00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.700
I'm sure it'll do the trick!

309
00:16:25.766 --> 00:16:27.000
Snover, eh?

310
00:16:27.066 --> 00:16:29.833
Might have something to do with that Abomasnow we saw.

311
00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:33.700
- Well, I'm ready for revenge!
- Wobbuffet.

312
00:16:40.266 --> 00:16:43.466
It's all done. I want you to drink this.

313
00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:51.066
Snover should be feeling better soon. It needs a good rest.

314
00:16:51.133 --> 00:16:52.866
- What a relief!
- Pika!

315
00:16:52.933 --> 00:16:55.166
Abomasnow.

316
00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.100
-Aboma!

317
00:16:58.166 --> 00:16:59.400
- What now?
- Pika!

318
00:16:59.466 --> 00:17:01.966
Abomasnow!

319
00:17:02.866 --> 00:17:04.466
- Mamoswine, too?
- Who are you?

320
00:17:04.533 --> 00:17:07.966
How could you do something so wrong?

321
00:17:08.033 --> 00:17:10.500
Prepare for trouble, one question at a time!

322
00:17:10.566 --> 00:17:12.966
Though asking us three would amount to a crime!

323
00:17:13.033 --> 00:17:15.466
To protect the world from devastation!

324
00:17:15.533 --> 00:17:18.266
To unite all people within our nation!

325
00:17:18.333 --> 00:17:21.200
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

326
00:17:21.266 --> 00:17:24.633
To extend our reach to the stars above!

327
00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.533
- Jessie!
- And James.

328
00:17:26.599 --> 00:17:30.033
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

329
00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:33.033
Surrender now or prepare for a flash-frozen fight!

330
00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:36.033
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

331
00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:40.700
- Team Rocket!
- What are you doing with Abomasnow?

332
00:17:40.766 --> 00:17:42.600
Preparing it for Team Rocket rule!

333
00:17:42.666 --> 00:17:45.700
- We won't let you do that!
- Pika!

334
00:17:45.766 --> 00:17:48.600
Huh. You big-talking twerp. You couldn't beat a rug!

335
00:17:48.666 --> 00:17:49.700
Gourgeist!

336
00:17:50.433 --> 00:17:52.800
Gourgeist! Gourgeist!

337
00:17:52.866 --> 00:17:55.766
OK, Inkay! Join the fray!

338
00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.933
Ink!

339
00:17:59.533 --> 00:18:01.633
Pikachu and I will distract Gourgeist.

340
00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.733
Pika!

341
00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.633
And while you're doing that, we'll rescue Abomasnow!

342
00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.966
- You've got it!
- You can do it, Clemont!

343
00:18:08.033 --> 00:18:09.800
Quit with the annoying yapping!

344
00:18:09.866 --> 00:18:12.200
Now, Gourgeist, rain down on them with Shadow Ball!

345
00:18:12.266 --> 00:18:14.166
Gourgeist!

346
00:18:14.233 --> 00:18:16.033
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

347
00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.400
Pika, pika, pi!

348
00:18:18.466 --> 00:18:21.133
- Now!
- Right!

349
00:18:23.133 --> 00:18:27.633
Huh. Whoa, there. You're not taking Abomasnow. Psybeam, let's go!

350
00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.200
Inkay!

351
00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:34.533
All right, Chespin, use Pin Missile!

352
00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.266
Chespin!

353
00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.933
- Pika.
- OK, let it go!

354
00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.933
No! Not with this Dark Pulse!

355
00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.466
Gourgeist!

356
00:18:46.533 --> 00:18:48.166
Dodge and use Iron Tail!

357
00:18:48.233 --> 00:18:51.000
Pikachu! Ah, Pika!

358
00:18:53.433 --> 00:18:54.600
Oof! Ink.

359
00:18:54.666 --> 00:18:57.233
- Over here!
- Gour!

360
00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.866
Now, Chespin, use Vine Whip and give Braixen a little help!

361
00:19:00.933 --> 00:19:03.033
Ches!

362
00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.533
Che!

363
00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.966
Quickly, Braixen, use Scratch!

364
00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:09.200
Braixen!

365
00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:14.933
Snow!

366
00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.900
Abomasnow, snow!

367
00:19:16.966 --> 00:19:20.400
Here we go. Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

368
00:19:20.466 --> 00:19:24.166
Pika! Pikachu!

369
00:19:24.233 --> 00:19:26.700
Aboma!

370
00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.433
We're blasting off again!

371
00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.100
Wobbuffet!

372
00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.533
- We did it!
- Snover!

373
00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:37.700
- Snover!
- Pika!

374
00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:41.500
Wow, looks like Snover's feeling fine!

375
00:19:41.566 --> 00:19:44.033
-Pika!

376
00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:46.033
Snow!

377
00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.800
- That's great!
- Sure is!

378
00:19:47.866 --> 00:19:49.500
Mm-hm!

379
00:19:49.566 --> 00:19:52.000
Abomasnow!

380
00:19:55.133 --> 00:19:57.200
Snow! Sno!

381
00:19:57.266 --> 00:19:58.700
- Snow!
- See you!

382
00:19:58.766 --> 00:20:01.200
- Pika, pika!
- Take good care of yourselves!

383
00:20:01.266 --> 00:20:04.566
- See you again sometime!
- Bye-bye, you two!

384
00:20:04.633 --> 00:20:07.166
- Snow!
- Sno!

385
00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:13.600
It was a wild ride, but we managed to do it with everybody pitching in.

386
00:20:13.666 --> 00:20:15.866
- Yeah!
- Pika.

387
00:20:15.933 --> 00:20:20.766
We all simply used our strong points to cover everybody else's weaknesses.

388
00:20:20.833 --> 00:20:23.000
I'd say we all make a pretty excellent team.

389
00:20:23.066 --> 00:20:25.600
Mm-hm! We're the best team ever!

390
00:20:25.666 --> 00:20:28.166
Hey, I see a town!

391
00:20:28.233 --> 00:20:31.233
Just a little bit further. It won't be long now.

392
00:20:32.733 --> 00:20:37.400
Working together, our heroes managed to help Abomasnow and Snover.

393
00:20:37.466 --> 00:20:40.666
And with their successful trek over a snowy mountain,

394
00:20:40.733 --> 00:20:45.366
it's on to the Anistar Gym, as the journey continues!
